# Record the outdoor exit by entering a cave through its real warp, save/load inside, USE a Rope
# from the bag and arrive back at that recorded exit. One rope is consumed.
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_BIBAREL 40
give item platinum:ITEM_ESCAPE_ROPE 2
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_203 246 749 right
+0 wild flee
until idle
+0 press right
+1 release right
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_OREBURGH_GATE_1F"
advance text
until idle
+0 reload
until idle
+1 press x
+1 release x
until app start-menu
+1 tap entry:1
+1 tap pocket:0
+1 tap row:0
+1 tap menu:0
until app none
until idle
+0 assert position platinum:MAP_HEADER_ROUTE_203 246 749
+0 assert state bag.items[0].count 1
